<title>POLAND: Boryszew to convert registered shares.</title>
<headline>Boryszew to convert registered shares.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of the Polish chemical firm Boryszew SA will vote on December 19 on whether to convert 644,250 registered shares into common shares for public trade, the company said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Currently Boryszew has 2,244,250 shares outstanding, of which 644,250 are registered and privileged.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
